#: includes/admin.php:20
msgid "Pluginect Analytics locally stores daily pseudonymous visits, pages viewed, browsing events and technical information (network prefix used without being stored, browser, device, language, resolution and estimated country). A converted visit is linked to the WooCommerce order. No cookie is set by default; the optional attribution memory sets a signed origin cookie. Retention periods are configurable in Analytics → Settings."
msgstr ""

