#: views/parametres.php:188
msgid "<strong>No cookies are placed.</strong> The plugin does not write anything in visitors' browsers: neither cookies, nor local storage, nor session storage."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:193
msgid "<strong>The IP address is never recorded.</strong> It is used to calculate a fingerprint, then it is forgotten."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:194
msgid ""
"<strong>It is even truncated before this calculation</strong> — only the network is retained, never the address\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tcomplete. A fingerprint can therefore no longer be recalculated to find someone's visits\n"
"\t\t\t\t\twhose address we would know: it designates an entire network, not a person."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:195
msgid "<strong>The fingerprint changes every day</strong>: impossible to follow someone over time."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:196
msgid "<strong>Nothing comes out of your server.</strong> No third-party service, no transfer outside the European Union."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:197
msgid "<strong>No profiling</strong>, no cross-checking between sites."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:201
msgid ""
"These points are the conditions set by the CNIL so that an audience measurement is exempt from consent.\n"
"\t\t\t\tNo banner to display for this extension - which does not exempt you from having one for other trackers,\n"
"\t\t\t\tnor mention the measure in your privacy policy."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:205
msgid "What remains your responsibility"
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:207
msgid ""
"The extension measures; it does not put anyone in their place. By installing this plugin,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tyou are the <strong>data controller</strong> within the meaning of the GDPR, and the obligations\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tfollowing are your responsibility."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:210
msgid ""
"<strong>Informer.</strong> Mention audience measurement in your policy\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tconfidentiality: what is collected, why, for how long, and who to contact.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tThe information obligation does not depend on cookies — it applies as soon as there is\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\ttreatment."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:211
msgid ""
"<strong>Supporting a legal basis.</strong> Legitimate interest is appropriate for a measure\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tinternal audience. If you activate the attribution memory, a cookie is placed and the\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tquestion of consent arises again."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:212
msgid ""
"<strong>Keep a register.</strong> One line in your treatment register is enough\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tfor a store of this size, but it must exist."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:213
msgid ""
"<strong>Respond to requests.</strong> Right of access, rectification, erasure,\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\topposition. Anonymous visits are not subject to it; those attached to a\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\torder, yes."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:214
msgid ""
"<strong>Secure your hosting.</strong> The data lives in your WordPress database:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tbackups, passwords, updates, access to the database and the server are your responsibility\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\talone."
msgstr ""

#: views/parametres.php:215
msgid ""
"<strong>Notify a violation.</strong> Any data leak must be reported to the\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tCNIL within 72 hours, and to the people concerned if the risk is high."
msgstr ""

